如果电水壶出现漏水这类质量问题，需要先提交漏水部位的照片进行审核，确认属于质量问题后才能按售后流程处理；非质量原因的退货则要求商品未使用过。[E37649bd297fa] 另外，保修处理还需要确认购买凭证和具体故障类型，订单已完成不代表所有故障都能免费维修。[E1d030dcecb79]

如果您的水壶真的出现问题，可以随时把照片和订单信息发给我，我帮您核实具体处理方式。", "evidence": {"approval_required": false, "context": {"coverage": {"complete": true, "conflict_keys": [], "coverage_complete": true, "missing_requirement_ids": [], "partial_delivery_allowed": false, "task_completed": true}, "facts": [{"observation_started_at": "2026-09-08T16:37:45.839809+00:00", "observed_at": "2026-09-08T16:37:47.670139+00:00", "producer_id": "knowledge_search", "producer_version": "tool-output-v1", "requirement_id": "knowledge.active_source", "source_kind": "KNOWLEDGE_ASSERTED", "source_ref": "work:invocation:v1:ba422623e7cd57b7621003c6bbd823d9af860a3dc933272aa0a368ef7f5a0f3c:1:semantic-1:1:knowledge_search", "subject_ref": "tool-query:v1:70e4bb9c880103c98f39050349d827baf6ea36296c9c5ae11e1c57b1c6a7837c", "valid_until": null, "value": {"evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E37649bd297fa", "source": {"applicability": {"channel": "global", "effective_from": "2020-01-01T00:00:00+00:00", "effective_to": "", "product": "", "region": "global"}, "checksum": "d56a5f420234f044c3d77d337df0532298cd242c6f3d430770b49e4f885daa1a", "end_char": 29, "scope": "public", "source_id": "eval-shop:ec-055", "source_revision": "revision-v2-5478aef9ac70069736c8fb51a8c996d7", "source_type": "text", "start_char": 0}, "text": "模拟店铺电水壶非质量退货需未使用；漏水质量问题需照片审核。", "title": "用户猜测不作事实"}, {"evidence_id": "E1d030dcecb79", "source": {"applicability": {"channel": "global", "effective_from": "2020-01-01T00:00:00+00:00", "effective_to": "", "product": "", "region": "global"}, "checksum": "c56827e983af856367fc5d765c89a8a3d4886014296328eeb852f80834ca02e4", "end_char": 37, "scope": "public", "source_id": "eval-shop:ec-045", "source_revision": "revision-v2-bf08f1e385aab770fcfc9af1365b98cc", "source_type": "text", "start_char": 0}, "text": "模拟店铺保修需确认购买凭证与故障类型；订单已完成不代表所有故障都免费维修。", "title": "订单状态与质保"}, {"evidence_id": "Ee56a5a757636", "source": {"applicability": {"channel": "global", "effective_from": "2020-01-01T00:00:00+00:00", "effective_to": "", "product": ""